# Geier Reach Sanitarium: "{2}, {T}: Each player draws a card, then discards a card." Bot1 pays {2} with Mox Jet and Mox
# Pearl and taps the land; the pool is empty right after (exactly {2}). Each player draws one (Bot1 Mountain, Bot2
# Swamp), then each chooses from the whole hand, the drawn card included: Bot1 discards the Mountain it just drew,
# Bot2 an Island it held; both are discarded together (CR 101.4, 701.9). A second activation is refused: the land is tapped.

